{
    "title": "Indianapolis News from 13 WTHR",
    "description": "Stay up-to-date with the latest news and weather in the Indianapolis, IN area on the all-new free WTHR app from Channel 13. \r\n\r\nOur app features the latest breaking news that impacts you and your family, interactive weather and radar, and live video from our newscasts and local events.\r\n\r\nLOCAL & BREAKING NEWS\r\n\u2022 Receive real-time notifications for breaking news\r\n\u2022 Read the latest news as it happens in your area\r\n\u2022 Explore exclusive investigative stories\r\n\u2022 Browse photos, news clips, and raw video\r\n\r\nLOCAL WEATHER\r\n\u2022 Daily and hourly forecasts for your city\r\n\u2022 The latest forecasts from our meteorologists\r\n\u2022 Interactive radar maps\r\n\u2022 Sign up for government-issued severe weather alerts in your area\r\n\r\nLIVE VIDEO\r\n\u2022 Watch live video newscasts and breaking news from WTHR\r\n\r\nPERSONALIZATION\r\n\u2022 Discover and dive into topics that matter to you\r\n\u2022 Favorite topics to receive personalized updates\r\n\r\nOther Features:\r\n\u2022 Share stories & videos directly with your friends and family\r\n\u2022 See the latest updates and behind the scenes photos from your favorite anchors and reporters\r\n\u2022 Get information on school delays & closings as they happen\r\n\r\nThis is the official app of WTHR and wthr.com, the NBC affiliate serving the Indianapolis, IN area.\r\n\r\nGot feedback? Let us know how we can make this the best app experience for you! Send us a note at appfeedback@tegna.com.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.wthr.com/privacy\r\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information: https://www.wthr.com/do-not-sell-my-information\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.wthr.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stay up-to-date with the latest news and weather in the Indianapolis, IN area on the all-new free WTHR app from Channel 13. <br><br>Our app features the latest breaking news that impacts you and your family, interactive weather and radar, and live video from our newscasts and local events.<br><br>LOCAL &amp; BREAKING NEWS<br>\u2022 Receive real-time notifications for breaking news<br>\u2022 Read the latest news as it happens in your area<br>\u2022 Explore exclusive investigative stories<br>\u2022 Browse photos, news clips, and raw video<br><br>LOCAL WEATHER<br>\u2022 Daily and hourly forecasts for your city<br>\u2022 The latest forecasts from our meteorologists<br>\u2022 Interactive radar maps<br>\u2022 Sign up for government-issued severe weather alerts in your area<br><br>LIVE VIDEO<br>\u2022 Watch live video newscasts and breaking news from WTHR<br><br>PERSONALIZATION<br>\u2022 Discover and dive into topics that matter to you<br>\u2022 Favorite topics to receive personalized updates<br><br>Other Features:<br>\u2022 Share stories &amp; videos directly with your friends and family<br>\u2022 See the latest updates and behind the scenes photos from your favorite anchors and reporters<br>\u2022 Get information on school delays &amp; closings as they happen<br><br>This is the official app of WTHR and wthr.com, the NBC affiliate serving the Indianapolis, IN area.<br><br>Got feedback? Let us know how we can make this the best app experience for you! Send us a note at appfeedback@tegna.com.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.wthr.com/privacy<br>Do Not Sell My Personal Information: https://www.wthr.com/do-not-sell-my-information<br>Terms of Service: https://www.wthr.com/terms",
